From 11f3526e878f36f05d9a34ca20cd7d69d5289352 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 10:53:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] round C1.7: production Clerk entry (live keys by declaration,
 /client-login is always the card)

Tao, 2026-09-11: release to planning.goaa.ai on C1; no legacy users; the
/client-login routing freeze is lifted: production goes straight to the
Clerk card, the old email+password form is retired, login returns to
/planning.

- app/lib/clerk-entry.ts
  * GOAA_CLERK_INSTANCE (not a second switch): unset/"development" = the C2
    test stack, test keys only (unchanged); "production" = live keys only.
    Both keys must match the declared kind, in both directions; anything
    else, or an unreadable instance value, is "misconfigured" (503 on the
    Clerk-dependent paths). The 503 detail names variables, never values.
  * next may now also name exactly /planning (DEFAULT_LOGIN_NEXT).
    Rejection reason renamed outside-agent-loop -> outside-allowed-landings.
  * unifiedEntryNext(): valid next kept, anything else -> /planning.
- middleware.ts: with Clerk in charge every /client-login visit is
  rewritten to the card (marker as before); other query parameters, which
  only the retired form read, are dropped. A half configured deployment
  now refuses /client-login too instead of showing the retired form.
  Golden /agent-login, the retired /agent-loop/login alias, the exposure
  guard and the loopback origin handling are unchanged.
- app/goaa-clerk-login/page.tsx: "Continue as guest" link to /planning,
  replacing the retired form's dismiss. Plain link, writes nothing.

Untouched: app/client-login/page.tsx (still byte-identical, served only
while Clerk is off), layout, bridge, BFF, backend.

Tests
- scripts/c2-clerk/test-entry-rules.mjs: 16 -> 20 (instance x key kind,
  wrong-kind detail never shows a key, /planning exact landing, public
  entry default). Fails 6 on the old code.
- scripts/c2-clerk/test-middleware.mjs: "not rewritten without a valid
  next" becomes "opens the card and lands on /planning" (11 shapes incl.
  resume/reason/google/order), + next=/planning kept, misconfigured now
  refuses /client-login. 15 -> 16. Needs the real next + @clerk/nextjs.
- scripts/test-clerk-production-entry.cjs (6): transpiled clerk-entry,
  middleware wiring, guest link, and no live secret-prefix literal anywhere
  in app/ or scripts/ (fixtures assemble it, so the relay scan stays clean).

